      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JAVEN'S SHOT (8) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by 2.5 lengths at Rockhampton in a handy 23.94 beating Rachel Sparkles. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Looks the testing material. NON STOP WHISKEY (1) was well fancied last time on the strength of the win two back but could only manage third (30.24) at this track. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Bold showing expected. TOTE DEOR (7) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (30.31) in a Mix 5 at this track. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. The form out of his last race has been franked. Has the ability to give this a shake. FORGIVENESS (4) is one of the chances after a surprise minor prize last time.",
